{"id":"vechno","lemma":"вечно","pos":"adv","rank":632,"glosses":["always, forever, eternally","perpetually, everlastingly","constantly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c0/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Вы действительно хотите жить вечно?","en":"Do you really want to live forever?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to live"},null]},{"text":"Люди не могут жить вечно.","en":"People can't live forever.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1777","words":[{"g":"people, humans"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to live"},null]},{"text":"Ты хочешь жить вечно?","en":"Do you want to live forever?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to live"},null]},{"text":"Я хочу быть с тобой вечно.","en":"I want to be with you forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Мы вечно будем вместе.","en":"We will be together forever.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"together"}]}]}